                                        <h3>What was Beardo's acquisition price?</h3>
                                        <p>Reported ~₹500 Cr paid by Marico in 2020. One of India's earliest major D2C acquisitions.</p>
                                        <h3>Why did Marico buy Beardo?</h3>
